# Dependency directories
# No trailing slash. `node_modules/` matches a *directory* only, so a symlink
# named node_modules — which is how a git worktree is given the dependencies
# it has no copy of — slipped past it and was committed. Merged, that symlink
# names an absolute path that exists on one machine, and `bun install` on any
# other fails outright with ENOENT rather than replacing it.
node_modules
jspm_packages/

